{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32668","headline":"送李休秀才归岭中 · 刘沧","name":"送李休秀才归岭中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南泛孤舟景自饶，蒹葭汀浦晚萧萧。\n秋风汉水旅愁起，寒木楚山归思遥。\n独夜猨声和落叶，晴江月色带回潮。\n故园新过重阳节，黄菊满篱应未凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}